# Figma MCP ↔ XOrA (current build)

Figma MCP is configured for this repo in `.cursor/mcp.json` (`https://mcp.figma.com/mcp`). Authenticate with **Cursor Settings → Tools & MCP → Connect** next to Figma (OAuth). Cloud agents need the same HTTP server enabled in the Cloud Agents MCP dropdown.

Canonical file: https://www.figma.com/design/sZn7Pye8J4o1ldduKhYCZm (`fileKey` `sZn7Pye8J4o1ldduKhYCZm`)

When a Figma URL is in the prompt, extract `fileKey` and `node-id` (`1-2` → `1:2`). Load `/figma-design-to-code` before `get_design_context`. Load `/figma-use` before `use_figma`. Pass `clientLanguages: kotlin` and `clientFrameworks: Compose`.

