Glyphs live in `feature/home/src/main/res/drawable/xmb_figma_*.xml` and `XmbIcons.kt`.

## Workflow

1. Prefer `get_design_context` + `get_screenshot` on the node above before changing layout numbers.
2. Reuse existing Compose panes, tokens (`XoraForegroundShadow`, `XoraFonts`, `#EBEBEB` glyph fill), and vector drawables. Do not invent a parallel icon set.
3. Default file is https://www.figma.com/design/sZn7Pye8J4o1ldduKhYCZm. If the prompt has a different `figma.com/design/…?node-id=…` link, use that instead.
4. Code Connect (`add_code_connect_map`) needs a published library on an Organization/Enterprise plan. Until then, keep the table above as the mapping.
